     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Hello everyone!</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">I&#39;m trying to send an app\r\nto my <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389405994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nCqRbs2RCAva6pUdZZsOf\">shinyapps.io</a> account, but I have to use a proxy in my corp. However, when\r\ntrying to connect through rsconnect::setAccountInfo, using the proxy options\r\nlisted bellow I get this error message (and those options work fine for\r\nconnecting to github/bitbucket for example.</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">With:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">options(RCurlOptions =\r\nlist(proxy = &quot;http://user:pwd@proxy:port&quot;))</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">options(shinyapps.http =\r\n&quot;rcurl&quot;)</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">This error:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font size=\"3\">Error in\r\nsocketConnection(host = host, port = as.integer(port), open =\r\n&quot;w+b&quot;,</font><span>  </span><font size=\"3\">: </font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><span>  </span></span><span style=\"color:black\">não é possível abrir a conexão</span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Além disso: Warning\r\nmessage:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font size=\"3\">In socketConnection(host =\r\nhost, port = as.integer(port), open = &quot;w+b&quot;,</font><span>  </span><font size=\"3\">:</font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span><font size=\"3\">  </font></span><font size=\"3\"><a href=\"http://api.shinyapps.io:80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://api.shinyapps.io:80&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389405994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29GcxQrAoqsZjiks9WEc1f\">api.shinyapps.io:80</a> cannot be opened</font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Timing stopped at: 0.08\r\n0.03 60.12</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">With:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">library(httr)</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Sys.setenv(http_proxy=&quot;myprox&quot;)</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font size=\"3\">set_config(</font><span>  </span><font size=\"3\">use_proxy(url=&quot;proxy&quot;, port=8080,\r\nusername=&quot;xx&quot;,password=&quot;xxxx&quot;))</font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">set_config(config(ssl_verifypeer\r\n= 0L))</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">The following error:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font size=\"3\">Error in function (type,\r\nmsg, asError = TRUE)</font><span>  </span><font size=\"3\">: </font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><span><font size=\"3\">  </font></span><font size=\"3\">Failed to connect to <a href=\"http://api.shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://api.shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389405994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XHzj1sxMRGgnoLUDbu_wT\">api.shinyapps.io</a> port\r\n443: Timed out</font></font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Timing stopped at: 0.03 0\r\n42.31</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Can anyone help me with\r\nthis issue? </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;vertical-align:middle\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Thank you all!</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></div></div>"
